Wrong (B): $70,000 has no computational basis here. The partner''s basis is the full $80,000 outside basis, not a blended amount.
Wrong (C): $90,000 is the FMV of the property. Basis in liquidating distributions is determined by outside basis, not fair market value.$EXPL$
